# SwiftPM/Xcode build dirs for the Swift package, whose manifest lives at the
# repo root. The UniFFI binding under packages/svg-editor-swift/uniffi-generated/
# is COMMITTED (a version-resolved clone runs no generators) — regenerate it
# with scripts/gen-bindings.sh; CI diffs it against crates/svg-editor-ffi.
